WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:04.798
Job hunting feels more manageable when you can see what to
do this week.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.420
Set your location, hours, and skill levels, then rebuild the
plan around your starting point.

3
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.144
Check off weekly tasks, track your time, then see what moved
in Weekly Review.

4
00:00:17.314 --> 00:00:20.109
Rate your skills and find courses to fill the gaps.

5
00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:25.611
Build your resume, check a job post for keywords, and shape
your LinkedIn and portfolio.

6
00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:31.059
Practice interview answers, track applications, and keep
networking and events in view.

7
00:00:31.559 --> 00:00:35.527
In What's New, like an article, mark it read, or save it to
your library.

8
00:00:36.027 --> 00:00:41.894
On supported desktop Chrome, optional AI runs on your
device. No account or key needed.

9
00:00:42.394 --> 00:00:44.165
Pick one task and make a start.
